  "scope": "GOLD-R4-12 partial: durable status.read device grants, daemon CLI/RPC, native bridge, Flutter Android/iOS sources, and hosted build lane",
  "behavior": [
    "A v3 invite pins the persistent daemon Noise key; enrollment binds separate durable client Noise and signing identities.",
    "Daemon restart preserves scoped device grants. Status responses are redacted, and unknown active turns remain unknown.",
    "Revoke persists the denying state, cancels and drains owned device tasks before final WAL-backed completion.",
    "A durable delivery marker remains after uncertain teardown or reload; only checked terminal completion clears it.",
    "Closed WAL mutation receipts bind exact redacted descriptors and recover enrollment/revoke idempotently.",
    "The mobile app protects a software seed with Keystore/Keychain storage and uses the shared native protocol.",
    "CocoaPods resolves the local framework directory; seven explicit linker roots and a final Runner symbol check protect Dart FFI linkage."
  ],
